This directory holds the optional GWC/WASM progressive-enhancement bundle for
the Promotion workspace. A stock checkout carries only this marker file, and
the workspace then serves the server-rendered document alone.

To build the bundle into this directory:

    GOOS=js GOARCH=wasm go build -o internal/humanwork/workspace/assets/uxqual.wasm ./tools/uxqual/cmd/uxqualwasm
    cp "$(go env GOROOT)/lib/wasm/wasm_exec.js" internal/humanwork/workspace/assets/wasm_exec.js

Neither file is committed: the server-rendered page is already the qualified
renderer (definitions/ux/workspace-renderer-decision.yaml), so a multi-megabyte
binary in the source tree would buy nothing a reader can see.
